{"cells": [{"cell_type": "markdown", "metadata": {}, "source": ["# Gate 4 - Indian-English Accent Conversion Strength Sweep", "", "**Purpose:** Verify that AccentConverter produces monotonically increasing accent change at multiple strength levels while preserving acoustic quality and speaker identity.", "", "**Pass criteria:**", "- Identity shift at strength=0 ~= 0", "- Identity shift at strength=1 > 0.15", "- Identity shift increases monotonically", "- mel L1 < 0.5 at all strengths", "", "**Method:**", "1. Load L2-ARCTIC Indian-English test utterances", "2. Run AccentConverter at 5 strength levels per utterance", "3. Measure mel L1, ECAPA identity shift, and WER", "4. Plot strength curves and generate pass/fail table", "5. Save artifacts to Drive"]}, {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["# 1. Mount Google Drive", "from google.colab import drive", "drive.mount(\"/content/drive\")", "print(\"Drive mounted at /content/drive\")"]}, {"cell_type": "code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["# 2. Install system dependencies", "!apt-get update -qq", "!apt-get install -y -qq espeak-ng > /dev/null 2>&1", "print(\"espeak-ng installed\")"]}], "metadata": {"accelerator": "GPU", "colab": {"gpuType": "T4", "provenance": []}, "kernelspec": {"display_name": "Python 3", "name": "python3"}, "language_info": {"name": "python"}}, "nbformat": 4, "nbformat_minor": 0}